      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua:233",
        "answer": "Frontend XP wrapper directly constructs this horizontal list. XP icon VisibleWZ requires current playlist double XP AND mainMode mode_warzone; Visible requires current playlist double XP. Weapon XP requires current playlist double weapon XP; tier boost uses current lobby tier boost. lobbyNav/playlistId/AutoEvents.cycled callbacks reevaluate XP and weapon icons; lobbyMainMode reevaluates tier icon. A ZMDoubleNP child is constructed independently; its own predicate is preserved under unit201. No reward grant or account operation. CallOriginalSecond close registers self.__onClose outside selected span as a dependency; optional postload then self return. Playlist/native mode/bonus values remain conditional.",
